[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4668656437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120131#issuecomment-4668656437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120131","id":4668656437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFkYLNQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T09:33:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T09:33:19Z","body":"Just to confirm: is this reproducible in a running game. Or is it specific to the editor with custom resources that are not `@tool` annotated?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4668656437/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4669784871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120131#issuecomment-4669784871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120131","id":4669784871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFldDJw","user":{"login":"2shady4u","id":42484461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDg0NDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42484461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u","html_url":"https://github.com/2shady4u","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T11:43:07Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T11:44:53Z","body":"> Just to confirm: is this reproducible in a running game. Or is it specific to the editor with custom resources that are not `@tool` annotated?\n\nI just retried the following cases:\n- Add `@tool` annotation to both Fruit and Basket\n  _Result:_ **Same issue**\n- Reproduction in a running game:\n  _Result:_ **Same issue**\n\nHere's the first save:\n```\nCreating or loading basket with path 'res://resources/basket20.tres'\n(res://basket_resource.gd):<GDScript#-9223372002562144828>\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"Basket\" format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://fruit_resource.gd\" id=\"1_1tynv\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://basket_resource.gd\" id=\"2_j511x\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"Resource\" id=\"Resource_vij2a\"]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_1tynv\")\nid = &\"starfruit\"\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"2_j511x\")\nfruits = Array[ExtResource(\"1_1tynv\")]([SubResource(\"Resource_vij2a\")])\n\n```\n\nSecond save:\n```\nCreating or loading basket with path 'res://resources/basket20.tres'\n[gd_resource type=\"Resource\" script_class=\"Basket\" format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://fruit_resource.gd\" id=\"1_1tynv\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://basket_resource.gd\" id=\"2_j511x\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"Resource\" id=\"Resource_1tynv\"]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_1tynv\")\nid = &\"starfruit\"\n\n[resource]\nscript = ExtResource(\"2_j511x\")\nfruits = Array[ExtResource(\"1_1tynv\")]([SubResource(\"Resource_1tynv\")])\n\n```\n\nAgain as you can see the sub_resource ID of the fruit has changed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4669784871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4671182940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120131#issuecomment-4671182940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120131","id":4671182940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFmyYXA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T14:15:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T14:15:15Z","body":"Also valid in 4.7 rc1.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4671182940/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751385656","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120131#issuecomment-4751385656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120131","id":4751385656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGzRkOA","user":{"login":"2shady4u","id":42484461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDg0NDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42484461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u","html_url":"https://github.com/2shady4u","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2shady4u/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T12:07:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T12:07:42Z","body":"Seems this is caused by the way Godot saves resources:\n- When the file does not exist yet, it requires IDs for fruit_resource (1tynv), basket_resource and the sub resource\n- When the file already exists; only the sub resources need IDs -> They get the first ID \"1tynv\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751385656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]